Subject: [PATCH 19/32] Expose durable thread participants in sidebar

Project ordered participants from durable authored-event actor snapshots using provider-qualified PrincipalKey equality, with latest presentation retained in first-authored order. Carry the additive legacy-readable participant contract through the thread list and render ordered labeled names and avatars in the native row without presence or Notifications joins. Focused public producer, order/rehydration, sidebar, and typecheck verification passed.
